// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Curated reference calendar for the Event Head planner (Worldwide + India).
//
// RELIABILITY CONTRACT — read this before editing:
//  • Every date below is either a FIXED month/day rule (identical every year) or
//    an explicit per-year date recorded for a named festival.
//  • NOTHING in this file is generated by an AI model. Gemini is only ever asked
//    for *activity ideas* (see suggestDayPrograms in eventHeadController.js).
//    The model never returns, corrects, or invents a date for this calendar.
//  • `precision: 'lunar'` entries follow the Indian lunar calendar / moon sighting
//    and can differ by a day between the gazette notification and local observance.
//    They are flagged in the UI so a coordinator confirms before planning.
//  • If a year has no row for a lunar festival, that festival is simply OMITTED
//    for that year rather than guessed.
//  • Rows in the `holidays` table (added through /api/holidays) are merged on top
//    by mergeCustomObservances() and override a curated row with the same date +
//    name, so a correction never needs a redeploy.
//
// Entry shape:
//   { m, d, name, scope, kind, themes[], precision?, note? }        — fixed rule
//   { date: 'YYYY-MM-DD', name, scope, kind, themes[], … }         — per-year row
//
// scope : 'worldwide' | 'india'
// kind  : 'observance' | 'national' | 'festival' | 'religious' | 'week'
// themes: slugs used to ground Gemini suggestions in the org's 12 sectors.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

